    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Vow-sworn Crusaders",
    "summary": "As battle round one opens, you may pick one **Vow** for your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units. It remains active through battle end. **Abhor the Witch**, Destroy the Witch gives both **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** and **[[LANCE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)** to melee attacks against a **PSYKER** unit. **Accept Any Challenge**, No Matter the Odds gives melee attacks +1 to **[wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** when the target’s **T** exceeds the attack’s **S**. **Uphold the Honour** of the Emperor applies to **INFANTRY** units. Treat an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** as **[secured](vsdata:core-rule/secured-objectives)** at your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)’s close if one of those units controls it. An **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** still lets the chosen unit **[start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)**. **Restrictions:** **BLACK TEMPLARS** units are permitted. **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** from another Chapter are excluded.",
